  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hey there! I’ve got some fine Leeks for strong\nTrainers like you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065007900200074006800650072006500210020004920190076006500200067006F007400200073006F006D0065002000660069006E00650020004C00650065006B007300200066006F00720020007300740072006F006E0067000A0054007200610069006E0065007200730020006C0069006B006500200079006F0075002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "By the way, have you heard of a Pokémon called\nFarfetch’d?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007900200074006800650020007700610079002C0020006800610076006500200079006F00750020006800650061007200640020006F00660020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000630061006C006C00650064000A0046006100720066006500740063006820190064003F00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s always holding a plant stalk, which it\nsometimes wields as a weapon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Speaking of which, there’s a troubling rumor\ngoing around involving Farfetch’d and Leeks...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They say if you go to a certain spot at nighttime\naccompanied only by a single Farfetch’d that’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nholding a Leek...you’ll be suddenly ambushed!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could you go fight off whoever’s behind this?\nShould be no sweat for a strong Trainer like you!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI’ll even give you a good, sturdy Leek for the job.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Go down the alley in <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Rouge Sector 7<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> at <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>night<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> with\nonly a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Leek<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>-wielding <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Farfetch’d<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> on your team...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthen fight off anyone who tries to attack you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 184
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You remember what the requester told you...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“Go down the alley in <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Rouge Sector 7<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> at <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>night <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>with\nonly a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Leek<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>-wielding <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Farfetch’d<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> on your team...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthen fight off anyone who tries to attack you!”",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 229
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What a fine-looking Leek you have... I challenge\nyou to a duel of Farfetch’d and fate!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "W-wait, why’s that stalk so huge?! Is that a\nGalarian Farfetch’d? N-no matter!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kuwah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B007500770061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guwah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007500770061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have at you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200061007400200079006F0075002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now, back to business...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0077002C0020006200610063006B00200074006F00200062007500730069006E006500730073002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I underestimated you—forgive my disrespect!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200075006E0064006500720065007300740069006D006100740065006400200079006F007520140066006F007200670069007600650020006D007900200064006900730072006500730070006500630074002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Masterful stalk-wielding technique... Unflinching\nresolve against an oniony onslaught...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou must certainly be a Trainer of great renown.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "To best him with such aplomb... A skillful display.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00200062006500730074002000680069006D0020007700690074006800200073007500630068002000610070006C006F006D0062002E002E002E0020004100200073006B0069006C006C00660075006C00200064006900730070006C00610079002E00100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now it’s my turn—I challenge you to the fight of\nour chives!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0077002000690074201900730020006D00790020007400750072006E201400490020006300680061006C006C0065006E0067006500200079006F007500200074006F00200074006800650020006600690067006800740020006F0066000A006F007500720020006300680069007600650073002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My comrade’s defeat is my defeat... I must avenge\nthis dishonor!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200063006F006D00720061006400652019007300200064006500660065006100740020006900730020006D00790020006400650066006500610074002E002E002E002000490020006D0075007300740020006100760065006E00670065000A007400680069007300200064006900730068006F006E006F0072002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait, wait, wait—GALARIAN Farfetch’d?! Guh...\nRegardless! I shall fight with allium my strength!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kuuuwah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00750075007500770061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guwah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007500770061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have at you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200061007400200079006F0075002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I concede!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200063006F006E0063006500640065002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Such strength is surely one in a scallion... How\nrelentlessly must one train to reach that level...?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, both my comrades have been bested...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F002C00200062006F007400680020006D007900200063006F006D00720061006400650073002000680061007600650020006200650065006E0020006200650073007400650064002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I mustn’t let Les Trois Poireaux fall into disgrace.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006D007500730074006E201900740020006C006500740020004C00650073002000540072006F0069007300200050006F006900720065006100750078002000660061006C006C00200069006E0074006F002000640069007300670072006100630065002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I am Bouché, leader of the three Leek wielders...\nand the mightiest member of our gallant trio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I shall now demonstrate the power of the Kanto\nStalk Style.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300680061006C006C0020006E006F0077002000640065006D006F006E007300740072006100740065002000740068006500200070006F0077006500720020006F006600200074006800650020004B0061006E0074006F000A005300740061006C006B0020005300740079006C0065002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You think your Galarian Farfetch’d can stop me?\nTime for a taste of the Kanto Stalk Style!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prepare yourself!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000720065007000610072006500200079006F0075007200730065006C0066002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GUWAAAH!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700550057004100410041004800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kuwah!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00750077006100680021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have at you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200061007400200079006F0075002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Most impressive!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F0073007400200069006D00700072006500730073006900760065002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kuwah! Kuuuwah... Guuuwah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B007500770061006800210020004B007500750075007700610068002E002E002E0020004700750075007500770061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heh heh heh...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006800200068006500680020006800650068002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Phew! Now those were some duels of derring-do!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000680065007700210020004E006F0077002000740068006F007300650020007700650072006500200073006F006D00650020006400750065006C00730020006F0066002000640065007200720069006E0067002D0064006F002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry about all that. To tell you the truth, we’re\nreal big fans of the movie Les Trois Poireaux.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve long dreamed of acting out a scene from\nthe movie...with Pokémon battles just like those.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But to make that happen, we needed a Farfetch’d\nand Trainer strong enough to stand up to our trio.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s when you came into the picture. I sent you\ndown this alley, and the rest is history!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I didn’t tell you the whole story from the start\nbecause I wanted to build up a little suspense...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sorry for tricking you—hope we didn’t ruffle\nyour feathers too badly.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But thank you for making our dream come true!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020007400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F00720020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006F0075007200200064007200650061006D00200063006F006D006500200074007200750065002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I got to quote all my favorite lines... I’ll relish this\nmoment till the end of my days!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our Farfetch’d played their parts gallantly too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500720020004600610072006600650074006300682019006400200070006C0061007900650064002000740068006500690072002000700061007200740073002000670061006C006C0061006E0074006C007900200074006F006F002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kuwah! Kuwahhh... Guuuwah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
